WEBVTT

00:00:01.108 --> 00:00:11.936
tezaur mcp is a Model Context Protocol server over stdio: Claude Desktop, Claude Code or Cursor can read your library, read-only.

00:00:11.986 --> 00:00:20.540
A client talks JSON-RPC. Here we play the client ourselves: initialize, then ask which tools exist.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:30.013
Call tezaur_search: the passages come back with citation labels the assistant must use as its only evidence.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:39.688
Add it to your client's config as command tezaur, args mcp and --index — the repository has ready-made snippets.
